{
  "id": "030",
  "title": "The Misunderstanding",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-01-30",
  "synopsis": "Sometimes homonyms can cause misunderstandings in Chinese. In today’s story we see how “抄” and “超”, both pronounced chāo, caused confusion.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/49/e207b083d6fd50be326294de6e8fc71b5a12125b.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "“抄”和“超”\n\n    家长会结束后，数学老师向我介绍儿子的学习情况时说：“这学期他抄过王红、抄过刘畅，也抄过张磊，我认为你应该好好管管了。”\n    我感到特别奇怪，问：“他都超过班长王红了，我管什么呢？”\n    老师回答：“我说的是，他抄人家作业。”",
    "traditional": "“抄”和“超”\n\n    家長會結束後，數學老師向我介紹兒子的學習情況時說：“這學期他抄過王紅、抄過劉暢，也抄過張磊，我認為你應該好好管管了。”\n    我感到特別奇怪，問：“他都超過班長王紅了，我管什麼呢？”\n    老師回答：“我說的是，他抄人家作業。”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“抄” and “超”"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "家长会结束后，数学老师向我介绍儿子的学习情况时说：",
      "traditional": "家長會結束後，數學老師向我介紹兒子的學習情況時說：",
      "pinyin": "jiā zhǎng huì jié shù hòu shù xué lǎo shī xiàng wǒ jiè shào ér zi de xué xí qíng kuàng shí shuō",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "“这学期他抄过王红、抄过刘畅，也抄过张磊，我认为你应该好好管管了。”",
      "traditional": "“這學期他抄過王紅、抄過劉暢，也抄過張磊，我認為你應該好好管管了。”",
      "pinyin": "zhè xué qī tā chāo guò wáng hóng chāo guò liú chàng yě chāo guò zhāng lěi wǒ rèn wéi nǐ yīng gāi hǎo hǎo guǎn guǎn le",
      "english": "After the parent-teacher conference ended, the math teacher turned to me to explain the state of my son's studies and said:"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“This semester, he copied Wang Hong, copied Liu Chang, and also copied Zhang Lei, I think should look after him better.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "我感到特别奇怪，问：“他都超过班长王红了，我管什么呢？”",
      "traditional": "我感到特別奇怪，問：“他都超過班長王紅了，我管什麼呢？”",
      "pinyin": "wǒ gǎn dào tè bié qí guài wèn tā dōu chāo guò bān zhǎng wáng hóng le wǒ guǎn shén me ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It struck me as strange, so I asked: “He even surpassed class leader Wang Hong, what do I have to look after?”"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "老师回答：“我说的是，他抄人家作业。”",
      "traditional": "老師回答：“我說的是，他抄人家作業。”",
      "pinyin": "lǎo shī huí dá wǒ shuō de shì tā chāo rén jia zuò yè",
      "english": ""
    }
  ],
