    "sentence_translations": [
      "“抄” and “超”",
      "",
      "After the parent-teacher conference ended, the math teacher turned to me to explain the state of my son's studies and said:",
      "“This semester, he copied Wang Hong, copied Liu Chang, and also copied Zhang Lei, I think should look after him better.”",
      "",
      "It struck me as strange, so I asked: “He even surpassed class leader Wang Hong, what do I have to look after?”",
      "",
      "The teacher answered: “I am saying that he copied other people's homework.”"
